      ],
      "text": "The tonic merchant quickly crafts a Antidote (Lesser), Antiplague (Lesser), or Elixir of Life (Minor) and lobs it at a willing or Unconscious ally within 30 feet. The elixir affects the ally as though they imbibed it.\n\nThe tonic merchant can use the rarest materials in their toolkit to improve the item to a Antidote (Moderate), Antiplague (Moderate), or Elixir of Life (Lesser). Afterward, they must spend 10 minutes gathering new ingredients before they can do so again."
